================================================================================
Studio: create Group_ Business View when a group is created
================================================================================

Context:
Creating an ontology group did not produce a matching Business View. On new
group create only, Studio now snapshots a view named Group_<groupName>
(suffix if taken) with the group's members and internal links, without
switching the canvas away from the current view. Edits and deletes leave
existing views alone.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   createBusinessViewFromGroup reuses _createMapBusinessView with
   applyAfter: false; the helper restores the previous named view after save.
2. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-groups.js
   After a successful create (_editIndex < 0), call createBusinessViewFromGroup.
3. tests/units/front/test_studio_views_groups_contract.py
   Contract that create (not edit) wires Group_ view creation.
4. tests/units/front/test_ontology_map_multi_select.py
   Shared-helper contract includes the group builder and extra switch restore.

