================================================================================
Studio toolbar: expand/collapse all ontology groups
================================================================================

Context:
Studio already collapsed and expanded a group from the + / − badges on the
canvas. There was no toolbar control to collapse or expand every group in one
click.

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/partials/ontology/_ontology_map.html
   Added #studioToggleAllGroupsBtn next to the Groups dropdown.
2. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-map.js
   Toggle collapses every group, or expands them all when they are already
   collapsed; one persist + rebuild. Disabled when the ontology has no groups.
3. tests/units/front/test_studio_views_groups_contract.py
   Toolbar id, APIs, and single persist/rebuild contract.
4. docs/user-guide.md
   Studio groups paragraph mentions the toolbar toggle.
5. src/front/templates/partials/layout/help_modal.html
   Studio help line mentions expand/collapse all from the toolbar.

